# Ragon's release signing keys (specs/DREAMFERENCE_RELEASE_SIGNING.md). Every release from
# 0.9.0 on carries SHA256SUMS.sig, an OpenSSH signature (`ssh-keygen -Y sign -n ragon-release`)
# of SHA256SUMS by one of these keys. `ragon update` compiles this file in (src/release_signature.rs),
# install.sh embeds the same lines (a test compares them), and the release job checks its own
# signature against it before publishing. One OpenSSH public key per line; '#' starts a comment.
ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAII9boVZe01adX9jSk8Hh/GAJURmqzCznictI3meZX0/i ragon-release-2026-11
